        <p>
          In Tamil Nadu, pension policy remains one of the most prominent topics of public discourse. Unlike central personnel who operate under the National Pension System (NPS) or the Unified Pension Scheme (UPS), post-2003 recruits in Tamil Nadu are enrolled in the state-managed <strong>Contributory Pension Scheme (CPS)</strong>:
        </p>
        <ul class="bullet-feature-list">
